# Standalone sibling repos that happen to live inside data/. Each is its own
# GitHub repo under VerisimLLC, NOT a submodule of data/ -- without these rules a
# stray `git add` here records them as gitlinks (bare commit pointers) instead of
# files, and the content silently never reaches this repo.
